{{wikipedia}}
{{wikispecies|Acheta domestica}}

===Etymology===
Compound of {{compound|en|house|cricket}}. It is frequently found in houses, between the bricks of chimneys and fireplaces.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[cricket]] of the [[species]] {{taxlink|Acheta domestica|species|noshow=1}}.

